{
  "name": "deps_record",
  "description": "The deps-updater agent's one writer: repository facts (managers, install, test and build commands, whether it installs), candidate updates (upserted by repo, ecosystem, package and version, with the Lemma's read, where the code uses it, what was tried, security reach, registry risk), the pull request it prepared or opened with its timeline steps and commits, and what the platform allowed. Applies ignores, keeps a person's choices, and writes the owner's held majors and risky releases to Today.",
